SUMMARY:Eve-of-the-Dormition panigiri\, Sidirounta
LOCATION:Sidirounta\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Sidirounta\, a hillside village on the west coast road to Volissos with a wide view over the Aegean\, holds a big open-air panigiri on the night of 14 August from 22:00 with a live orchestra (Makrokanis-Tzikas in 2026)\, free entry and food from the village taverna. Good stop if you are heading to the western beaches\; the road back to town is dark and winding.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#sidirounta-eve-of-the-dormition-panigiri-sidirounta
